          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Q.1. Give the dimensions of a rectangle whose area is the sum of the areas of these two rectangles having measurements: 5 m × 10 m and 2 m × 7 m.",
              "styles": [
                "bold"
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 16,
          "bbox": [
            0.115,
            0.729,
            0.799,
            0.747
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Ans.",
              "styles": [
                "bold"
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " Possible dimensions are 16 m and 4 m Or 32 m and 2m Or 8 m and 8 m"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 17,
          "bbox": [
            0.115,
            0.756,
            0.884,
            0.792
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Q.2. The area of a rectangular garden that is 50 m long is 1000 sq m. Find the width of the garden?",
              "styles": [
                "bold"
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
