              "content": " 20 m."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 19,
          "bbox": [
            0.115,
            0.828,
            0.883,
            0.865
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Q.3. The floor of a room is 5 m long and 4 m wide. A square carpet whose sides are 3 m in length is laid on the floor. Find the area that is not carpeted.",
